WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Each practice has its own rules: many give appointments by phone when they open, online or through the NHS App. The receptionist or «care navigator» will ask the reason: it is not nosiness, it helps send you to the right professional.

2
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:25.500
Prepare your symptoms in one sentence: what is wrong and since when. You can book by phone or in person.

3
00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:31.100
Listen to them and repeat them aloud before you call.

4
00:00:31.100 --> 00:00:38.300
Now do the lesson exercises. If you are unsure, watch this video again.
